"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5091090","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4450820-1842212951314635","game_id":"steam-4450820","kind":"announcement","title":"The boss got angry...","summary":"I decided it was about time I got around to implementing special abilties to the 3 boss variants in the game: charger, minion spawning and AoE damage/knockback based on the boss type is now part of the game, including the demo. While I was at it I also improved the graphics on a few different things such as the xp orbs and the bullets Any kind of feedback is much appreciated!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T20:23:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951314635","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4450820-1839676055893262","game_id":"steam-4450820","kind":"announcement","title":"Gearing up for early access","summary":"Gearing up for early access, Graphical overhaul, achievements, balance changesI have been working hard on updating all graphical elements in game, and adding new trailers and screenshots. I truly hope and believe this will make the experience better. This includes much improved sprites, effects and general feel of the game. Its a lot less of a empty black void now...Among other things weapons and powerups got icons instead of just coloured circles. There are also more splatter effects when killi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-02T19:51:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055893262","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4450820-1830797770231731","game_id":"steam-4450820","kind":"announcement","title":"More graphical effects...and weapons!","summary":"A quick general update on state of thingsQuite a bit of effort have gone into the game lately after initial publish on steam.A few highlights are : Graphical polish : Shadows to all ententies to provide a bit of depth in a 2d world. Background \"texture\" to avoid simply walking around on a black void. A few minor other things such as tiny footprints when moving and \"dust\" particles that move around to create a bit of texturei have also fixed an issue where the disolve shader that was used when ki","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-22T21:57:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770231731","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:26:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4450820":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:08Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:08Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4450820":"2026-10-26T12:30:08Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4450820":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:08Z"},"5091090":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:30:08Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4450820","app_id":4450820,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"0e77d1e2dbf424212e7997743a9472c66fe3ecb765dcf324f02d8f165f50e4eb","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_descrip